<item>
  <title>As disasters mount, next UN climate summit faces a test of trust</title>
  <link>https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168617</link>
  <description>Less than a month before the UN climate conference COP31 opens in Antalya, Türkiye, representatives of three successive summit presidencies gathered to address a pressing question: How can the world restore trust in climate action when the consequences of a warming planet are already being felt?</description>
